					"defaults": [
						{
							"type": "10",
							"modifier": 4
						}
					],
					"usage_notes": "Paralyzing Tongue (14): A mohrg can lash out with its tongue to paralyze its victim. This attack has Reach C, 1 and cannot parry. If the tongue touches bare skin, the victim must roll HT to resist. He becomes paralyzed for 3 seconds per point of margin of failure. After that the subject is stunned (p. B420) and may roll vs. HT once per second to recover."
				}
